# NovaOS - Package List (x86_64) - SLIM PROFILE
# Hardware: 2009-era Intel -> 2026 AMD/Nvidia/Intel ARC + ARM-prep
# Desktop : KDE Plasma 6 (Wayland) with Kvantum glass theme
# Avoids  : Ubuntu base, LXQt, XFCE
#
# Slimming strategy (target ~2.5-3 GB ISO, down from 7 GB):
#   - Keep: base system, all GPU drivers, Plasma 6 desktop, Wine, NovaOS Store,
#           NovaOS services, Python (for Store + daemons), basic viewers
#   - Drop (install on demand from NovaOS Store):
#       * Heavy media studio (Blender, Krita, GIMP, Inkscape, Audacity, OBS)
#       * Office suites (LibreOffice, Calligra) - users install what they need
#       * Dev toolchains (Rust, Go, Node, Dotnet, JDK, Maven, Gradle)
#       * Container/virtualization (Docker, QEMU, libvirt, OVMF)
#       * Duplicate disk tools (gparted, gnome-disk-utility)
#       * Duplicate fonts (Adobe Source Han - noto-fonts-cjk already covers)
#       * Niche network apps (filezilla, transmission)
#       * Debug tools (gdb, valgrind, perf, strace, ltrace)
################################################################################

